%% Conspicuous Usage — end-to-end sequence (V1 AiTM defense in action)
%% See docs/05-conspicuous-usage.md §3
sequenceDiagram
    participant Page as dApp page
    participant Pat as Patronus (out-of-DOM)
    participant SKM as IEphemeralSessionKeyManager
    participant DAG as L1 BlockDAG
    participant Sub as Patronus Subscriber
    participant User

    Page->>Pat: requestAction(intent)
    Pat->>Pat: evaluateRisk(ctx)
    Pat-->>User: out-of-DOM consent prompt (F1)
    User-->>Pat: approve (hardware-backed; F2)
    Pat->>SKM: installSessionKey(params w/ parentSessionId, requiredAal)
    SKM->>DAG: emit SessionIssued
    Pat->>SKM: signUserOp(userOpHash)
    SKM-->>SKM: validateUserOp (stateless; ADR-0007)
    SKM->>DAG: emit SessionUsed
    DAG-->>Sub: stream event (≤ 2 s)
    Sub-->>User: in-app alert (out-of-DOM)
    Note over User,DAG: 24h dispute window opens

    alt user disputes
        User->>Pat: dispute / revoke
        Pat->>SKM: revokeSessionKey(sessionId, reasonCode=stolen)
        SKM->>DAG: emit SessionRevoked
        DAG-->>Page: CAEP session-revoked SET (ADR-0008)
    else window closes
        DAG-->>DAG: "consented by silence" — finalized
    end
